	lvds_irx1/IBUFDS_adc_dclk/IBUFDS (in lvds_irx1/IBUFDS_adc_dclk macro) (IBUFDS.O) is locked to E6
	BUFG_lvds_dclk_2 (BUFG.I) is provisionally placed by clockplacer on BUFGCTRL_X0Y3

